# OPERATIONS §2.3 (M3) with §2 "For all three" and L §8.3: a path that names no file refuses the load as run refuses
# it, `refused: LOAD-PATH <path> doesn't exist`, the path as given; one line, exit 1. Run as the command line runs
# it, `check model.tally nope.tally`.
=== options disk check missing=nope.tally exit=1
=== model.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

source card "a card (invented)"

